<section style="padding: 96px 0; background: var(--color-charcoal); position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
  <div style="position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; width: 300px; height: 300px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(184,134,11,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px); text-align: center; position: relative; z-index: 1;">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 12px;" data-reveal>Cost Guide</span>
    <h2 class="font-heading" style="color: var(--color-text-light); margin-bottom: 20px;" data-reveal>
      What Does Your Project Cost?
    </h2>
    <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(240,237,232,0.7); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" data-reveal>
      Every project is unique, but we believe in transparent pricing. Our guide gives you realistic budget expectations for extensions, loft conversions, renovations and more.
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 40px;" data-reveal>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <span class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-brass-light); display: block;">£30k–£80k</span>
        <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(240,237,232,0.7); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">Extensions</span>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <span class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-brass-light); display: block;">£35k–£65k</span>
        <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(240,237,232,0.7); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">Loft Conversions</span>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <span class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-brass-light); display: block;">£50k–£150k+</span>
        <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(240,237,232,0.7); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">Renovations</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; justify-content: center;" data-reveal>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary btn-fill" style="padding: 16px 36px;">
        Get Your Free Quote
      </a>
      <a href="/insights/house-extension-cost-guide-2025/" class="btn-primary" style="padding: 16px 36px; color: var(--color-brass-light); border-color: var(--color-brass-light);">
        Read Full Cost Guide
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
